meta {
  name: requirements in set
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{workerUrl}}/internal/requirements/sets/{{standardVersionId}}/{{requirementSetVersion}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  materialOnly: false
}

assert {
  res.status: any [200, 401]
}

docs {
  INTERNAL. Every requirement in one set.

  materialOnly=false deliberately: an administrator judging extraction quality needs to see the
  advisory requirements that were excluded on purpose, or the extractor looks like it missed them.

  Note the identity — a requirement's _id is standardVersionId:requirementSetVersion:requirementId.
  `requirementId` ALONE is not unique: it recurs across standards, 47 of 191 in one three-standard
  comparison, which caused a real defect where one standard's finding overwrote another's.
}
